---
// The privacy notice's paragraph about price-change alerts, present only while alerts are offered.
import { ALERTS_URL } from '../../lib/site.mjs';
---
{ALERTS_URL && (
  <>
    <h2 id="price-alerts">Price-change alerts</h2>
    <p>If you sign up for price-change alerts, you do it on our email provider's sign-up page, which collects your email address (and your name, if you give it). We use it only to send those alerts, each email has a one-click unsubscribe link, and the provider stores the list for us under its own privacy terms.</p>
  </>
)}
